2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:09,560
Oh, hi. Hey, you've got to try this cheesecake. Oh, you know, I'm not that much of a sweet tooth.
哦，嗨。嘿，你一定要嚐嚐這個起司蛋糕。哦，你知道，我不太愛吃甜食。

3
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:19,000
Oh my god, so creamy. Oh my god, that is the best cheesecake I've ever had. Where did you get this?
天哪，太奶油了。天哪，這是我吃過的最好的起司蛋糕。你從哪裡得到這個？

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,640
It was at the front door when I got home. Somebody sent it to us.
當我回到家時，它就在前門。有人寄給我們了。

5
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:29,300
Chandler, this is not addressed to you. This is addressed to Mrs. Braverman downstairs.
錢德勒，這不是寫給你的。這是寫給樓下佈雷弗曼夫人的。

6
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:36,920
Thief. I didn't read the box before I opened it and you can't return a box
賊。我在開啟盒子之前沒有閱讀盒子，因此您無法退回盒子

7
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:39,880
after you've opened the box. Why not? Because it's too delicious.
開啟盒子後。為什麼不呢？因為實在是太好吃了。

8
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:47,460
Chandler, you stole this cheesecake. That is wrong. No, no, no, it is going to be okay
錢德勒，你偷了這個起司蛋糕。那是錯誤的。不不不，不會有事的

9
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:51,700
because Mrs. Braverman is going to send away for a free one and that way we all
因為佈雷弗曼太太會送人去領取一份免費的，這樣我們大家就都可以了

10
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:58,100
win. The only losers are the big cheesecake conglomerate, mama's little bakery.
贏。唯一的輸家是大型起司蛋糕集團、媽媽的小麵包店。

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,600
I feel terrible. I'm a horrible, horrible, horrible person. Well, I'm sorry, what?
我感覺很糟。我是一個可怕、可怕、可怕的人。好吧，對不起，什麼？

12
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:37,120
I'll be there for you.
我會在那等你。

13
00:01:46,740 --> 00:01:50,780
All right, I should get going. Big day at work. You know, I'm in a coma,
好吧，我該走了。工作中的重要一天。你知道，我正處於昏迷狀態

14
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:55,360
but today they do this test on me and it turns out I'm not brain dead.
但今天他們對我做了這個測試，結果證明我並沒有腦死。

15
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:02,240
Mr. Smarty Pants, it's just my character that's not brain dead.
聰明褲先生，只是我的性格沒有腦死而已。

16
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:07,620
Hey, Sophie, you still on for tonight? Absolutely. I'll see you at eight. Okay.
嘿，蘇菲，今晚你還有空嗎？絕對地。我八點見。好的。

17
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:13,180
Huh, what's at eight? Oh, I have dinner plans with Joey. We get together about once a month
呃，八點是什麼時候？哦，我有和喬伊共進晚餐的計劃。我們大約每月聚一次

18
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:20,780
to discuss the rest of you guys. Wow, did not know that. May I say how lovely you look today?
來討論你們其餘的人。哇，不知道。我可以說你今天看起來有多可愛嗎？

19
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:27,960
Duly noted. Oh, so for tomorrow, do you want to rent a car and drive down together or what?
適當指出。哦，那明天，你想租一輛車一起開車去還是什麼？

20
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:34,080
What are you talking about? Because in Franny's wedding, it's tomorrow night. You were invited?
你在說什麼？因為弗蘭妮的婚禮是在明天晚上。你被邀請了？

21
00:02:36,540 --> 00:02:42,080
No. I can't believe this. I mean, I knew that mom and dad were invited,
不，我不敢相信這一點。我是說，我知道爸爸媽媽被邀請了

22
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:47,080
but I thought that was it. I mean, from the ages of seven to nine, Franny and I were inseparable.
但我想就是這樣了。我的意思是，從七歲到九歲，弗蘭妮和我形影不離。

23
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:50,600
Well, maybe since the age of nine, Franny's made some new friends.
嗯，也許從九歲起，弗蘭妮就認識了一些新朋友。

24
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:55,280
Do you want to make some new friends?
你想交一些新朋友嗎？

25
00:02:57,560 --> 00:03:00,780
Well, it's probably just a mistake. Let me call Aunt Cheryl, okay?
嗯，這可能只是個錯誤。讓我給謝麗爾阿姨打電話，好嗎？

26
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:04,260
Maybe you are invited and the invitation just got lost in the mail.
也許您受到了邀請，但邀請函在郵件中遺失了。

27
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:07,600
Yeah, well, you call her and tell her that, you know, when we were kids,
是的，好吧，你打電話給她並告訴她，你知道，當我們還是孩子的時候，

28
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:12,460
her precious little Franny tried to undress me several times, okay? And if I hadn't stopped her,
她可愛的小弗蘭妮好幾次想脫我的衣服，好嗎？如果我沒有阻止她

29
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,500
there probably wouldn't even be a wedding to go to.
可能連婚禮都沒辦法去。

30
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:20,380
She tried to undress me, too. I used to undress my cousin, Glenn,
她也試著脫我的衣服。我曾經給我表弟格倫脫衣服

31
00:03:20,380 --> 00:03:31,640
too. Joseph Francis Triviani, are you home yet?
也。約瑟夫·弗朗西斯·特里維亞尼，你到家了嗎？

32
00:03:32,660 --> 00:03:36,620
Um, I think he's still out. What's wrong? Well, I'll tell you, Rachel Karen Green.
嗯，我想他還沒出來。怎麼了？好吧，我告訴你，雷切爾·凱倫·格林。

33
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:40,360
I had plans with Joey tonight and he left me this note.
今晚我和喬伊有計劃，他留了這張紙條給我。

34
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:45,540
Phoebs can't make it. Got a date. Talk to you later. Big Daddy.
菲比無法做到這一點。有個約會。我們回聊。大爸爸。

35
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:50,240
Big Daddy? Oh, that's a nickname we were trying out.
大爸爸？哦，這是我們正在嘗試的暱稱。

36
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,920
Why don't you guys try out Francis?
你們為什麼不試試看法蘭西斯呢？

37
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:56,580
Francis is a cooler name than Chandler, isn't it?
法蘭西斯比錢德勒更酷，不是嗎？

38
00:03:58,300 --> 00:04:02,140
You know what nickname never caught on? The Rossitron.
你知道哪個暱稱從未流行起來嗎？羅西特龍。

39
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:08,620
Hey. Oh, here's Joseph Francis.
嘿。哦，這是約瑟夫·弗朗西斯。

40
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:14,180
What are you middle-naming me for? I left you a note.
為什麼要給我取中間名？我留了一張紙條給你。

41
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:16,780
So what? That doesn't give you the right to ditch me.
所以呢？這並不意味著你有權利拋棄我。

42
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:20,300
Hey, you can cancel plans with friends if there's a possibility for sex.
嘿，如果有可能發生性行為，你可以取消與朋友的計劃。

43
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:23,860
Maybe he's right. That is the rule. Really?
也許他是對的。這就是規則。真的嗎？

44
00:04:24,580 --> 00:04:27,900
Well, that's what I hear. I've never gotten a chance to actually employ the rule.
嗯，這就是我聽到的。我從來沒有機會真正運用這條規則。

45
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:33,960
Well, I don't accept this rule. When we make plans, I expect you to show up,
嗯，我不接受這個規則。當我們制定計劃時，我希望你出現，

46
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:37,380
okay? I can't just be a way to kill time till you meet someone better.
好的？在你遇到更好的人之前，我不能只是消磨時間的一種方式。

47
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:41,760
You know, boyfriends and girlfriends are gonna come and go, but this is for life.
你知道，男友和女朋友會來來去去，但這是一輩子。

48
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:46,760
Wow. I'm so sorry. I had no idea it would bother you this much.
哇。我很抱歉。我沒想到這會讓你這麼煩惱。

49
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:50,220
Well, it does. Okay, can I make it up to you?
嗯，確實如此。好吧，我可以補償你嗎？

50
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:55,580
I'm sorry. How about dinner tomorrow night? I'll pay for myself.
對不起。明天晚上吃晚餐怎麼樣？我自己付錢。

51
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,640
Okay, you wore me down.
好吧，你讓我失望了。

52
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:05,800
Hey, Joe, while you're over there, how about another beer for the Rossitron?
嘿，喬，你在那邊的時候，再給 Rossitron 喝一杯啤酒怎麼樣？

53
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:09,180
Oh, is that back?
哦，回來了嗎？

54
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:21,560
Hi. Yeah, the cheesecake came.
你好。是的，起司蛋糕來了。

55
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,900
They delivered it to the wrong address again.
他們又把它送到了錯誤的地址。

56
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:28,040
So, just bring it back downstairs. What's the problem?
所以，就把它帶回樓下吧。有什麼問題嗎？

57
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,940
I can't seem to say goodbye.
我似乎無法說再見。

58
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:35,400
Are you serious? Chandler, we ate an entire cheesecake two days ago, and you want more?
你是認真的？錢德勒，兩天前我們吃了一整塊起司蛋糕，你還想要更多嗎？

59
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:37,900
I've forgotten what it tastes like, okay?
我已經忘記是什麼味道了，好嗎？

60
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:45,220
It was cheesecake. It was fine. It had a buttery, crumbly graham cracker crust
這是芝士蛋糕。很好。它有一層黃油狀、易碎的全麥餅乾外殼

61
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:52,200
with a very rich, yet light cream cheese filling.
裡面有非常豐富但清淡的奶油乳酪餡。

62
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:57,260
Wow, my whole mouth just filled with saliva.
哇，我的整個嘴巴都充滿了口水。

63
00:05:58,140 --> 00:06:02,720
You know what? Forget it. We are just hungry. We have not had lunch.
你知道嗎？忘了它。我們只是餓了。我們還沒吃午餐。

64
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:08,120
We are just lightheaded. So, let us go out and have lunch and forget about the cheesecake.
我們只是頭暈目眩。所以，讓我們出去吃午餐吧，忘掉起司蛋糕吧。

65
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,220
Yeah, we'll drop it off downstairs so that we're not tempted.
是的，我們會把它放在樓下，這樣我們就不會受到誘惑。

66
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:12,020
Good idea. Where do you want to go to lunch?
好主意。你想去哪裡吃午餐？

67
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:13,680
Mama's Little Bakery, Chicago, Illinois.
媽媽的小麵包店，伊利諾州芝加哥。

68
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:20,560
Oh, Mel Torme died.
哦，梅爾·託爾梅死了。

69
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,720
Joey, that paper's like a year old.
喬伊，那篇論文已經有一年了。

70
00:06:24,380 --> 00:06:26,860
Oh, does that mean the Sam Goody sale is over?
哦，這是否意味著 Sam Goody 促銷結束了？

71
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,000
Hey. Hey.
嘿。嘿。

72
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:31,300
Hey.
嘿。

73
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:36,800
So, I finally heard back from Aunt Cheryl, and apparently it wasn't a mistake.
所以，我終於收到了謝麗爾阿姨的回覆，顯然這不是一個錯誤。

74
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,140
There's limited seating in the hall.
大廳裡的座位有限。

75
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:42,840
Limited seating? I am just one tiny person.
座位有限？我只是一個小人物。

76
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:49,740
Well, yeah, but she doesn't know that. I mean, the last time she saw you,
嗯，是的，但她不知道。我是說，她最後一次見到你時

77
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,700
you would have turned one of those little wedding chairs into kindling.
你會把一張小婚禮椅子變成引火物。

78
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:58,160
Limited seating? Oh, that is such a lame excuse.
座位有限？哦，這真是一個蹩腳的藉口。

79
00:06:58,700 --> 00:07:00,820
It's the reason why she's not inviting me.
這就是她不邀請我的原因。

80
00:07:01,180 --> 00:07:04,960
What's the big deal? I wasn't even invited to the ceremony, just the reception.
有什麼大不了的？我甚至沒有被邀請參加儀式，只是參加招待會。

81
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:09,080
And you know what? If it makes you feel any better, Joan and I will just make an appearance,
你知道嗎？如果這能讓你感覺好一點的話，瓊和我就會露面，

82
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:12,980
and then we'll leave early as a sign of protest.
然後我們會提前離開以示抗議。

83
00:07:13,940 --> 00:07:15,860
Joan? Yeah, Joan Tedeschi, my date.
瓊？是的，瓊‧泰德斯基，我的約會物件。

84
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:19,140
She's an assistant professor in the linguistics department. Tall,
她是語言學系的助理教授。高大，

85
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:23,860
very beautiful, and despite what some people say, not broad-backed.
非常漂亮，儘管有人說，但並不寬闊。

86
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:31,360
Wait a minute, you got Ross Geller and guest? I wasn't invited, and you got and guest?
等一下，羅斯蓋勒和客人來了嗎？我沒有被邀請，你卻被邀請了？

87
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:37,000
Excuse me, I do have to interrupt on Ross's behalf. I think the rule applies here.
對不起，我必須代表羅斯打斷。我認為這條規則也適用於此。

88
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:39,580
You know, since he has a chance to get on broad-backed.
你知道，因為他有機會獲得廣泛的支援。

89
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:40,820
Not broad-backed.
沒有廣泛的支援。

90
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:44,700
Dude, I've seen her. She's like a billboard.
夥計，我見過她。她就像一塊廣告看板。

91
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:49,540
Wait a minute, you know what? You're bringing me.
等一下，你知道嗎？你帶我來。

92
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:51,640
I can't cancel on Joan.
我無法取消瓊的預約。

93
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:52,360
Why not?
為什麼不呢？

94
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:59,000
Did you not hear me? She's an assistant professor in the linguistics department, okay? They're wild.
你沒聽到我說話嗎？她是語言學系的助理教授，好嗎？他們很狂野。

95
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,260
Why do you want to come anyway?
為什麼還要來？

96
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:10,680
Because. She's my cousin. I mean, we grew up together. Family, and I don't know, that's
因為。她是我的表弟。我的意思是，我們一起長大。家人，我不知道，那就是

97
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,960
important to me.
對我來說很重要。

98
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:17,660
Okay, all right, I'll take you. I'll go call Joan.
好吧，好吧，我帶你去。我去打電話給瓊。

99
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:25,020
Oh, that's nice. Family should be there. This is her wedding. Happiest day of her life.
哦，那太好了。家人應該在場。這是她的婚禮。她一生中最快樂的一天。

100
00:08:25,580 --> 00:08:26,260
We'll see.
我們拭目以待。

101
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,500
Well, thank you for lunch.
嗯，謝謝你的午餐。

102
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,100
What? Wait a minute, I didn't pay. I thought you paid.
什麼？等一下，我還沒付錢。我以為你付了錢。

103
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:38,400
So apparently, we just don't pay for food anymore.
顯然，我們不再為食物付錢了。

104
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:42,860
Do you see what I see?
你看到我看到的了嗎？

105
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,860
It's still there.
它還在那裡。

106
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:47,260
Mrs. Braverman must be out.
佈雷弗曼太太肯定出去了。

107
00:08:52,020 --> 00:08:54,760
She could be out of town. Maybe she'll be gone for months.
她可能出城了。也許她會離開幾個月。

108
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:59,040
By then, the cheesecake may have gone bad. We don't want her to come back to bad cheesecake.
到那時，起司蛋糕可能已經變質了。我們不想讓她再吃到糟糕的起司蛋糕。

109
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:00,020
No, that could kill her.
不，那會殺了她。

110
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,080
Well, we don't want that.
好吧，我們不希望這樣。

111
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:02,260
No, so we're protecting her.
不，所以我們要保護她。

112
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,020
Well, we should take it.
好吧，我們應該接受它。

113
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,000
Yeah, but we should move quick.
是的，但我們應該快點行動。

114
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:04,320
Why?
為什麼？

115
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:06,080
Because I think I just heard her moving around in there.
因為我想我剛剛聽到她在那裡走動。

116
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:08,740
Go, go, go, go, go, go, go, go, go.
走，走，走，走，走，走，走，走，走。

117
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:15,260
Do you think that it's inappropriate to wear a white lacy dress to a wedding?
你認為穿白色蕾絲禮服參加婚禮不合適嗎？

118
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:16,140
Yes.
是的。

119
00:09:16,740 --> 00:09:17,180
Excellent.
出色的。

120
00:09:21,580 --> 00:09:23,560
Oh, my God, that's David.
哦，天哪，那是大衛。

121
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:24,380
David who?
大衛是誰？

122
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:27,380
David, the scientist guy, David, that I was in love with.
大衛，我所愛的科學家大衛。

123
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:30,440
David who went to Russia and broke my heart, David.
大衛，他去了俄羅斯，傷了我的心，大衛。

124
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:31,920
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

125
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:34,320
Oh, you say someone's name and then they turn around.
哦，你說出某人的名字，然後他們就會轉過身來。

126
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:37,640
Phoebe.
菲比。

127
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:39,220
David.
大衛.

128
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,240
What, what are you doing here?
什麼，你在這裡做什麼？

129
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:45,520
Aren't you supposed to be in Russia?
你不是應該在俄羅斯嗎？

130
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:47,920
Yeah, I'm just, I'm just in town for a conference.
是的，我只是來城裡參加一個會議。

131
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,140
God, you look phenomenal.
天啊，你看起來棒極了。

132
00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:53,740
Well, yeah.
嗯，是的。

133
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,400
You look great, too.
你看起來也很棒。

134
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,060
Did you get a haircut?
你剪頭髮了嗎？

135
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:00,780
Yeah, well, I got like 30 of them.
是的，好吧，我有大約 30 個。

136
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:04,740
Um, look, I got a confession to make.
嗯，聽著，我要坦白。

137
00:10:05,060 --> 00:10:07,560
Um, I was hoping to run into you here.
嗯，我本來希望能在這裡遇見你。

138
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,100
I didn't know whether I should call or not.
我不知道該不該打電話。

139
00:10:09,180 --> 00:10:11,540
You know, I was only in town for a few days and, you know,
你知道，我只在城裡待了幾天，你知道，

140
00:10:11,580 --> 00:10:14,260
I didn't want to intrude on your life or anything like that.
我不想打擾你的生活或類似的事情。

141
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:16,120
But I really wanted to see you.
但我真的很想見你。

142
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:18,800
But I didn't know if you wanted to see me.
但我不知道你是否想見我。

143
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:22,120
Well, of course I would want to see you.
嗯，我當然想見你。

144
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:24,940
I, I think about you all the time.
我，我無時無刻都在想你。

145
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,840
Really? Because I think about you all the time.
真的嗎？因為我無時無刻都在想你。

146
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:32,280
I mean, there's a statue in Minsk that reminds me of you so much.
我的意思是，明斯克有一座雕像讓我非常想起你。

147
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:34,380
I mean, um, it's actually of Lenin.
我的意思是，嗯，這實際上是列寧的。

148
00:10:35,420 --> 00:10:37,300
Like, you know, at certain angles.
就像，你知道，在某些角度。

149
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:37,660
Yeah.
是的。

150
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:41,480
Anyway, do you want to have dinner, uh, tonight?
不管怎樣，今晚你想吃晚餐嗎？

151
00:10:41,860 --> 00:10:42,220
Yes.
是的。

152
00:10:43,500 --> 00:10:44,220
Oh, no.
哦，不。

153
00:10:45,940 --> 00:10:46,940
Oh, uh, what?
哦，呃，什麼？

154
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:49,620
I can't. I can't believe I have plans. I can't.
我不能。我不敢相信我有計劃。我不能。

155
00:10:49,740 --> 00:10:50,860
Can you do it tomorrow night, though?
不過明天晚上你能做嗎？

156
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:53,520
Uh, no. I, I have to go in a few hours.
呃，不。我，我幾個小時後就得走了。

157
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,660
I have to be on the red eye.
我必須紅眼。

158
00:10:56,060 --> 00:10:59,360
Well, listen, you know, next time you're in Minsk, uh...
好吧，聽著，你知道，下次你在明斯克時，呃......

159
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:01,360
Baby, can I talk to you for a second?
寶貝，我可以跟你聊聊嗎？

160
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,060
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

161
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:03,920
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

162
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:05,900
Well, I have plans with Joey tonight.
好吧，今晚我和喬伊有計畫。

163
00:11:06,260 --> 00:11:07,420
So? He'll understand.
所以？他會明白的。

164
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:08,580
No, he won't.
不，他不會。

165
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,140
And that's not even the point.
這還不是重點。

166
00:11:10,140 --> 00:11:15,880
Monica, I made a whole speech about how you do not cancel plans with friends.
莫妮卡，我做了一個關於如何不取消與朋友的計劃的完整演講。

167
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,860
And now, you know what?
現在，你知道嗎？

168
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:21,500
Just because, potentially, the love of my life comes back from Russia
只是因為，我一生的摯愛有可能從俄羅斯回來

169
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:24,460
just for one night, I, I should change my beliefs?
僅僅一晚，我、我就該改變我的信仰嗎？

170
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,960
I should change my beliefs.
我應該改變我的信念。

171
00:11:28,180 --> 00:11:29,480
No. No.
不，不。

172
00:11:29,740 --> 00:11:32,200
No, if I don't have my principles, I don't have anything.
不，如果我沒有原則，我就一無所有。

173
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,300
God, you are so strong.
天哪，你太強大了。

174
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:38,020
Or I should rush through dinner with Joey and I could meet David at nine.
或者我應該趕緊和喬伊一起吃晚飯，這樣我就可以在九點見到大衛。

175
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:44,560
Oh, my God, that is so good.
哦，天哪，那太好了。

176
00:11:44,860 --> 00:11:45,780
I'm full.
我吃飽了。

177
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:49,560
And yet, I know if I stop eating this, I'll regret it.
然而，我知道如果我停止吃這個，我會後悔的。

178
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:54,000
Hey, what do you got there?
嘿，你那裡有什麼？

179
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:56,980
Oh, it's, um, it's tofu cake.
哦，這是，嗯，這是豆腐糕。

180
00:11:57,100 --> 00:11:57,520
Do you want some?
你想要一些嗎？

181
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,360
What are you doing tonight?
今晚你在做什麼？

182
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:05,820
Dude, dude.
夥計，夥計。

183
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:08,640
Oh, sorry.
哦，抱歉。

184
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:11,000
Uh, I got those plans with Phoebe.
呃，我和菲比有這些計畫。

185
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:11,320
What?
什麼？

186
00:12:11,580 --> 00:12:12,020
Oh, really?
哦真的嗎？

187
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:14,180
Monica said she had a date at nine.
莫妮卡說她九點有個約會。

188
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:15,080
What?
什麼？

189
00:12:15,340 --> 00:12:15,740
Tonight?
今晚？

190
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:17,300
That's what Monica said.
莫妮卡就是這麼說的。

191
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:19,220
After she gave me that big speech?
在她給我做了那麼重要的演講之後？

192
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:21,980
She goes and makes a date with a guy on the same night she has plans with me?
她在和我有計畫的同一天晚上就去和一個男人約會？

193
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:24,700
I think she's trying to pull a fast one on Big Daddy.
我想她是想跟老爹較量一番。

194
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:28,380
Now, if you'll excuse me.
現在，請原諒。

195
00:12:28,740 --> 00:12:29,700
Dude, dude, dude.
夥計，夥計，夥計。

196
00:12:29,980 --> 00:12:32,540
If I took off my pants right now, how would you feel?
如果我現在脫掉褲子，你會有什麼感覺？

197
00:12:33,660 --> 00:12:34,580
Like your cousin, Glenn.
就像你的表弟格倫。

198
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:43,060
Oh, here.
哦，在這裡。

199
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,000
I think this is us.
我想這就是我們。

200
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:47,720
Limited seating, my ass.
座位有限，我的屁股。

201
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,280
Let's just see who made the cut.
讓我們看看誰晉級了。

202
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:51,620
Hi.
你好。

203
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:52,320
Hi.
你好。

204
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:53,300
I'm Monica Geller.
我是莫妮卡·蓋勒。

205
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:55,440
How do you know the bride and groom?
你怎麼認識新娘和新郎？

206
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:56,620
Oh, I used to work with Franny.
哦，我以前和弗蘭妮一起工作過。

207
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:57,760
Used to work with her.
曾經和她一起工作過。

208
00:12:58,220 --> 00:12:58,880
Used to.
習慣了。

209
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:01,140
I'm her relative, but I didn't get invited.
我是她的親戚，但我沒有被邀請。

210
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,260
A blood relative.
是有血緣關係的親戚。

211
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:03,840
Blood.
血。

212
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:08,200
Stop saying blood to strangers.
別再對陌生人說血話了。

213
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:11,460
From the ages of seven to nine, we were inseparable.
從七歲到九歲，我們形影不離。

214
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,280
Inseparable.
形影不離。

215
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,720
And I didn't even get invited to this.
我甚至沒有被邀請參加這個活動。

216
00:13:13,940 --> 00:13:14,940
Then why are you here?
那你為什麼在這裡？

217
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:17,200
My brother's date.
我哥哥的約會。

218
00:13:17,620 --> 00:13:19,260
I had a date, okay?
我有約會，好嗎？

219
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:20,680
Joan Tedeschi.
瓊‧泰德斯基.

220
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:21,900
The linguist.
語言學家。

221
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:24,760
So, how about you?
那麼，你呢？

222
00:13:25,340 --> 00:13:26,560
How do you know the happy couple?
你怎麼認識這對幸福的夫妻？

223
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,980
We went to college with both of them.
我們和他們兩個一起上大學。

224
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,060
And now we live next door.
現在我們住在隔壁。

225
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,260
Okay, you're fine.
好吧，你沒事。

226
00:13:34,740 --> 00:13:36,360
You know, you would have liked Joan.
你知道，你會喜歡瓊的。

227
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:37,600
She's very pleasant.
她很令人愉快。

228
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:40,300
There, there.
那裡，那裡。

229
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:41,580
Her back looks like that.
她的背影就是這樣的。

230
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:43,280
That's not broad, is it?
這並不寬泛，是嗎？

231
00:13:49,100 --> 00:13:49,800
Come on, Joey.
來吧，喬伊。

232
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,360
You've got to be ready to order by now.
您現在必須準備好訂購了。

233
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:52,660
You know what?
你知道嗎？

234
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:54,340
I don't think I like this table either.
我想我也不喜歡這張桌子。

235
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,500
Maybe we should move again.
也許我們應該再搬家。

236
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,820
No, we're staying right here.
不，我們就待在這裡。

237
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:57,460
Excuse me.
打擾一下。

238
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:58,180
We're ready to order.
我們已經準備好訂購了。

239
00:13:58,820 --> 00:13:59,780
I don't work here.
我不在這裡工作。

240
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:03,180
Well, then you shouldn't be walking around.
好吧，那你不應該到處走動。

241
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:07,320
Hey.
嘿。

242
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:07,860
Hi.
你好。

243
00:14:07,860 --> 00:14:08,780
Are you guys ready yet?
你們準備好了嗎？

244
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:09,380
Yeah, uh-huh.
是啊，嗯。

245
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:12,100
I'm gonna have the green salad with the house dressing.
我要吃蔬菜沙拉和自製調味料。

246
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:13,280
Water's fine.
水就好了

247
00:14:15,180 --> 00:14:15,980
And you, sir?
那你呢，先生？

248
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:18,700
Yeah, this slow-roasted salmon.
是的，這個慢烤鮭魚。

249
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:20,680
Just how slow are we talking?
我們說話到底有多慢？

250
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,640
It's, um, it's already been roasted.
嗯，已經烤好了。

251
00:14:24,020 --> 00:14:25,080
Oh, then no.
哦，那就不行了。

252
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:27,980
Maybe I should hear those specials again.
也許我應該再聽一次這些特價節目。

253
00:14:28,420 --> 00:14:30,940
Oh, Joey, we've heard the specials three times, okay?
哦，喬伊，我們已經聽過三次特價了，好嗎？

254
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:35,020
There's prime rib, mahi-mahi, and a very special lobster ravioli.
這裡有上等肋排、鯕鰍魚和非常特別的龍蝦餛飩。

255
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:37,160
Actually, we're out of the lobster ravioli.
事實上，我們的龍蝦餛飩已經賣完了。

256
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:39,180
Oh, well, that changes everything.
哦，好吧，這改變了一切。

257
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:42,860
You know what, Peebs?
你知道嗎，皮布斯？

258
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:43,200
Huh?
啊？

259
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:44,500
You were right before.
你之前是對的。

260
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,820
Friends are so important.
朋友是如此重要。

261
00:14:47,060 --> 00:14:48,080
Yeah, I'm very wise.
是的，我很聰明。

262
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:48,420
I know.
我知道。

263
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:48,980
Yeah.
是的。

264
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:51,180
You know what I really want?
你知道我真正想要什麼嗎？

265
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:51,580
What?
什麼？

266
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:53,980
Is to have a long, long talk.
就是要好好地談一談。

267
00:14:54,740 --> 00:14:57,880
You know, get Joey out on the open road and really open him up.
你知道，把喬伊帶到開闊的道路上，讓他真正敞開心扉。

268
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,400
Any progress?
有進展嗎？

269
00:15:00,820 --> 00:15:01,200
Yes.
是的。

270
00:15:02,260 --> 00:15:04,000
I will have the lobster ravioli.
我要龍蝦餛飩。

271
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:07,480
Oh, God, Joey, this is taking forever.
哦，上帝，喬伊，這要花很長時間。

272
00:15:07,820 --> 00:15:08,540
What's the rush?
急什麼？

273
00:15:08,660 --> 00:15:08,780
What?
什麼？

274
00:15:09,060 --> 00:15:14,480
Well, I just said that I have, you know, I have an appointment, and it's very important.
嗯，我只是說我有一個約會，這非常重要。

275
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,680
Oh, well, what is it?
哦，好吧，那是什麼？

276
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,560
Well, it's a date.
嗯，這是一個約會。

277
00:15:20,140 --> 00:15:20,780
A date?
約會？

278
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:25,940
No, no, Peebs, you must be mistaken, because I know you wouldn't schedule a date on the
不，不，皮布斯，你一定是搞錯了，因為我知道你不會在

279
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:27,280
same night you have plans with a friend.
當晚你和朋友有計劃。

280
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:29,680
Come on, Joey, don't make me feel badly about this.
得了吧，喬伊，別讓我為此感到難受。

281
00:15:29,700 --> 00:15:30,200
No, I'm gonna.
不，我要去。

282
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:36,620
That's right, yeah, you made me feel really guilty about going out with that girl, like,
是的，是的，你讓我對和那個女孩出去感到非常內疚，就像，

283
00:15:36,740 --> 00:15:38,560
like, like I did something terrible to you.
就像，就像我對你做了一些可怕的事情。

284
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:40,500
Now, Peebs, you're doing the same thing.
現在，皮布斯，你也在做同樣的事情。

285
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:41,780
It's not the same thing.
這不是同一件事。

286
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,340
This is totally different.
這是完全不同的。

287
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:44,520
This is with David.
這是和大衛在一起的。

288
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:46,520
Remember David, the scientist guy?
還記得科學家大衛嗎？

289
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:48,440
Okay, he's very special to me.
好吧，他對我來說很特別。

290
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:50,600
Okay, well, my girl from the other night was special.
好吧，那天晚上我的女孩很特別。

291
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:51,900
She was a scientist, too.
她也是一位科學家。

292
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:53,020
She was?
她？

293
00:15:53,620 --> 00:15:54,840
Well, she graduated high school.
還好，她高中畢業了。

294
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,360
Okay, whatever.
好吧，無論如何。

295
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:57,820
You know what?
你知道嗎？

296
00:15:57,900 --> 00:16:01,340
I don't have time to convince you, because he's only here for four hours, and I'm gonna
我沒有時間說服你，因為他只在這裡待四個小時，而我要

297
00:16:01,340 --> 00:16:01,920
go see him.
去看他。

298
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:02,320
Fine.
美好的。

299
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:02,740
Yeah.
是的。

300
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:03,280
Fine.
美好的。

301
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:03,620
Yeah.
是的。

302
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:06,860
What are you still doing here?
你還在這裡做什麼？

303
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:08,500
I told you, lobster ravioli.
我告訴過你了，龍蝦餛飩。

304
00:16:12,420 --> 00:16:12,780
Hey.
嘿。

305
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:13,420
Hey.
嘿。

306
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:14,860
Oh, I was just about to leave.
哦，我正要離開呢。

307
00:16:14,980 --> 00:16:16,260
I didn't think you were coming.
我沒想到你會來。

308
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,920
Oh, why wouldn't I miss this?
哦，我為什麼不能錯過這個呢？

309
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:20,820
Well, I'm very glad you're here.
嗯，我很高興你在這裡。

310
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,500
Oh, you're such a gentleman.
哦，你真是一位紳士。

311
00:16:24,180 --> 00:16:25,320
Come on, we're going to my place.
走吧，我們去我家。

312
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:25,620
Oh.
哦。

313
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:35,380
Are you eating the cheesecake without me?
你在沒有我的情況下吃起司蛋糕嗎？

314
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:41,360
I will give you a hundred dollars to whistle right now.
我現在就給你一百美元讓你吹口哨。

315
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:48,460
How can you eat the cheesecake without me?
沒有我怎麼吃起司蛋糕？

316
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,380
Oh, what are you gonna do?
哦，你要做什麼？

317
00:16:49,460 --> 00:16:50,480
Are you gonna go run and tell Monica?
你要跑去告訴莫妮卡嗎？

318
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:51,420
Are you gonna tell Joey?
你要告訴喬伊嗎？

319
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:53,480
No, because then you're gonna have to tell them what we did.
不，因為那樣你就必須告訴他們我們做了什麼。

320
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:54,940
We are dessert stealers.
我們是甜點偷竊者。

321
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,600
We are living outside the law.
我們生活在法律之外。

322
00:16:57,900 --> 00:16:58,400
You know what?
你知道嗎？

323
00:16:58,420 --> 00:17:02,520
I don't trust you with this cake anymore, and I got it first, and I'm taking it back.
我不再相信你能把這塊蛋糕託付給你了，而且是我先拿到的，我要把它收回來。

324
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:02,800
What?
什麼？

325
00:17:03,220 --> 00:17:03,840
Oh, yes.
哦是的。

326
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:05,440
No, no, no, no, no, no, you don't.
不，不，不，不，不，不，你不知道。

327
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:06,040
No, no.
不，不。

328
00:17:06,840 --> 00:17:08,640
You think I trust you with it?
你以為我會信任你嗎？

329
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:09,780
No, we're gonna split it.
不，我們要分開。

330
00:17:09,780 --> 00:17:10,920
You take half, and I take half.
你拿一半，我拿一半。

331
00:17:10,940 --> 00:17:11,600
Well, that's not fair.
嗯，這不公平。

332
00:17:11,660 --> 00:17:12,500
You've already had some.
你已經吃過一些了。

333
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:13,720
Oh, you know what?
哦，你知道嗎？

334
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:18,480
I think Monica would be very interested to know that you called her cheesecake dry and mealy.
我想莫妮卡會很想知道你稱她的起司蛋糕是乾的和粉狀的。

335
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:20,340
What do we use to split it?
我們用什麼來分割它？

336
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:20,660
Okay.
好的。

337
00:17:23,740 --> 00:17:25,180
All right, pick a half.
好吧，選一半。

338
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:25,920
Okay.
好的。

339
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,960
Well, this side looks bigger.
嗯，這一面看起來更大。

340
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:33,320
Uh, there's more crust on this side.
呃，這邊還有更多的外殼。

341
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:34,240
Yeah.
是的。

342
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:35,600
So...
所以...

343
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:36,580
Even if I measure...
即使我測量...

344
00:17:36,580 --> 00:17:37,760
Oh, for God's sake, just pick a piece.
哦，看在上帝的份上，就選一塊吧。

345
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:38,900
All right, I'll pick that one.
好吧，我就選那個。

346
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,720
So the smaller piece.
所以較小的一塊。

347
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:44,460
Okay, there you go.
好的，就這樣吧。

348
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:47,520
Enjoy your half, my friend, but that is it.
享受你的一半吧，我的朋友，但僅此而已。

349
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:53,660
No sharing, no switching, and don't come crying to me if you eat your piece too fast.
不分享，不交換，如果你吃太快，也別哭著來找我。

350
00:17:53,660 --> 00:17:54,360
Oh!
哦！

351
00:17:58,460 --> 00:17:58,940
Oh!
哦！

352
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:06,160
All right, you gotta give me some of your piece.
好吧，你得給我一些你的作品。

353
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:08,020
Oh, no, no.
哦，不，不。

354
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:11,440
No switching, no sharing, and don't come crying to me.
沒有切換，沒有分享，也不要來找我哭。

355
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:15,680
I may just sit here and have my cake all day.
我可能整天坐在這裡吃蛋糕。

356
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:18,280
Just sit here in the hallway and eat my...
就坐在走廊上吃我的...

357
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:34,840
Oh, hey, Aunt Millie.
哦，嘿，米莉阿姨。

358
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:37,080
Isn't it a beautiful wedding?
這不是一場美麗的婚禮嗎？

359
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:38,500
Yes, yes, it is.
是的，是的，確實如此。

360
00:18:43,820 --> 00:18:45,660
Every time on the lips.
每次都掛在嘴邊。

361
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:47,160
Why? Why on the lips?
為什麼？為什麼在嘴唇上？

362
00:18:51,500 --> 00:18:52,120
Here's Franny.
這是弗蘭妮。

363
00:18:52,580 --> 00:18:53,940
Won't you be happy to see me?
見到我你會不高興嗎？

364
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:54,820
Now, wait a minute.
現在，等一下。

365
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:56,100
You be nice, all right?
你乖一點，好嗎？

366
00:18:56,140 --> 00:18:58,240
I didn't bring you here so you can ambush her.
我帶你來這裡不是為了讓你伏擊她。

367
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:01,700
Franny was the one who found your Playboys and showed them to Mom.
弗蘭妮找到了你的《花花公子》並將其展示給媽媽。

368
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:02,840
That bitch.
那個賤人。

369
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:09,060
Monica!
莫妮卡！

370
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:11,840
What am I doing here?
我在這裡做什麼？

371
00:19:12,220 --> 00:19:12,620
Why?
為什麼？

372
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:13,480
Surprised to see me?
看到我很驚訝嗎？

373
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:14,560
Ross brought me.
羅斯帶我來的。

374
00:19:14,700 --> 00:19:15,420
How do you like that?
你覺得怎麼樣？

375
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:17,140
Hi, Franny.
嗨，弗蘭妮。

376
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:17,860
Congratulations.
恭喜。

377
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:21,440
You invite my brother?
你邀請我兄弟了？

378
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:23,420
You invite my whole family and not me?
你邀請了我全家而不邀請我？

379
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:23,840
Why?
為什麼？

380
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:25,520
Why wouldn't you want me at your wedding?
你為什麼不希望我參加你的婚禮？

381
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:27,520
What could I have possibly done?
我本來可以做什麼？

382
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:29,980
Stuart.
史都華.

383
00:19:31,580 --> 00:19:33,140
I believe you know my husband.
我相信你認識我的丈夫。

384
00:19:35,420 --> 00:19:38,620
So it's really a question of who could you have possibly done.
所以這實際上是一個你能做誰的問題。

385
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:50,680
I hate this, but I have to go.
我討厭這樣，但我必須走。

386
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:52,660
I can't miss my flight.
我不能錯過航班。

387
00:19:53,300 --> 00:19:54,280
Are you sure?
你確定嗎？

388
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:56,140
I'll bet there's another flight to Minsk in like...
我敢打賭還有另一班飛往明斯克的班機...

389
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:56,380
July.
七月。

390
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,260
It's really beautiful.
真的很漂亮。

391
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:09,480
What does it mean?
這是什麼意思？

392
00:20:09,940 --> 00:20:11,420
Please clean my beakers.
請清潔我的燒杯。

393
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:14,980
I don't get out of the lab much.
我很少離開實驗室。

394
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:20,220
I thought it meant I was something else.
我以為這代表我是另外一個人。

395
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,520
Yeah, I...
是的，我...

396
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:25,520
Well, I really actually wanted to say that,
嗯，其實我其實很想說，

397
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:29,320
but I figured I probably shouldn't because, you know,
但我想我可能不該因為，你知道，

398
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:32,120
I have to leave.
我必須離開。

399
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:33,440
No, you're right.
不，你是對的。

400
00:20:33,820 --> 00:20:34,660
You're right. Don't say it.
你說得對。別說了。

401
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:38,320
I do, though.
不過我願意。

402
00:20:40,900 --> 00:20:41,900
I do, too.
我也是。

403
00:20:51,940 --> 00:20:52,880
Yeah, bye, Phoebe.
是的，再見，菲比。

404
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:06,680
Okay, now's not the time, Joey, all right?
好吧，現在還不是時候，喬伊，好嗎？

405
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:07,720
You can yell at me tomorrow.
明天你可以罵我。

406
00:21:08,080 --> 00:21:09,500
Hey, no, no, no.
嘿，不，不，不。

407
00:21:09,660 --> 00:21:10,880
I'm not gonna yell at you.
我不會對你大吼大叫。

408
00:21:11,980 --> 00:21:14,160
Just, you know, I started thinking about you and David,
只是，你知道，我開始想你和大衛，

409
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:17,960
and I remember how bummed you were the first time you left.
我記得你第一次離開時有多沮喪。

410
00:21:18,020 --> 00:21:18,380
I just...
我只是...

411
00:21:20,340 --> 00:21:21,940
Oh, Phoebe, just come in here.
哦，菲比，進來吧。

412
00:21:23,580 --> 00:21:24,420
Are you okay?
你還好嗎？

413
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:26,300
No, I'm not okay.
不，我不好。

414
00:21:27,340 --> 00:21:31,140
The only guy I've ever been crazy about is Wanda Minsk,
我唯一為之瘋狂的人是旺達·明斯克

415
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:31,980
and I never...
而我從來沒有...

416
00:21:31,980 --> 00:21:33,120
I may never see him again.
我可能再也見不到他了。

417
00:21:34,040 --> 00:21:35,960
Hey, you know, you could always visit him.
嘿，你知道，你可以隨時去看他。

418
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:38,340
Oh, right, like they're gonna let me have a passport.
哦，對了，就像他們會給我護照一樣。

419
00:21:40,520 --> 00:21:42,600
If there's anything I can do, whatever you need.
如果有什麼我可以做的，無論你需要什麼。

420
00:21:45,100 --> 00:21:49,360
Well, Bud, now, if you could achieve positronic distillation
好吧，巴德，現在，如果你能實現正電子蒸餾的話

421
00:21:49,360 --> 00:21:51,980
of subatomic particles, you know, before he does,
亞原子粒子，你知道，在他之前，

422
00:21:52,060 --> 00:21:53,020
then he could come back.
然後他就可以回來了。

423
00:22:00,180 --> 00:22:01,580
I could give it a shot.
我可以嘗試一下。

424
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:10,460
Oh, hey, look, there's a piece that doesn't have fluorine in it.
哦，嘿，看，有一塊裡面沒有氟。

425
00:22:11,340 --> 00:22:12,580
Stick to your science.
堅持你的科學。

426
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:13,580
Come on, now.
來吧，現在。

427
00:22:25,260 --> 00:22:26,940
All right, what do we have?
好吧，我們有什麼？

428
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:36,820
Oh, wait, I forgot my wrap.
哦，等等，我忘了帶包裹。

429
00:22:37,380 --> 00:22:38,820
Oh, I'll wait here for you.
哦，我就在這裡等你。

430
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:40,200
I can't go back there.
我不能回到那裡。

431
00:22:40,420 --> 00:22:40,880
Why?
為什麼？

432
00:22:41,380 --> 00:22:43,360
Did you see the way that Stuart was staring at me?
你看到史都華盯著我的眼神了嗎？

433
00:22:43,840 --> 00:22:45,160
I think he still wants me.
我想他還是想要我。

434
00:22:45,320 --> 00:22:46,280
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

435
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:47,940
Just go do it.
就去做吧。

436
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:49,300
All right, wait here.
好吧，就在這裡等吧。

437
00:23:08,420 --> 00:23:10,160
Hi, sweetie, are you leaving?
嗨，親愛的，你要離開嗎？

438
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,060
Well...
嗯...

439
00:23:11,060 --> 00:23:11,840
Give us a kiss.
給我們一個吻。

440
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:23,180
Why?
為什麼？

441
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:23,760
Why?
為什麼？

442
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:24,740
Why on the lips?
為什麼在嘴唇上？

